    "canonical_ref": "CCELANF093.1.42",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The whole narrative of the resurrection is so different from that of the canonical gospels that it would be useless to go into details; but it is important to notice the prominence assigned to Mary Magdalene, and:",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
