    "work_id": "ccel-anf/anf09/003",
    "canonical_ref": "CCELANF093.1.47",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "5. That the first appearance of Jesus must have taken place on the Lake of Gennesaret, either to Peter alone, or to Peter, Andrew, and Levi (Matthew), while fishing.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
